  {
   "text": "Tip one: no borders.",
   "s": 6.828,
   "e": 8.24
  },
  {
   "text": "Facebook says borders look like reposted content, so they may get less reach.",
   "s": 8.66,
   "e": 13.355
  },
  {
   "text": "Tip two: hook people fast, because fewer people watched this one past twenty seconds.",
   "s": 13.775,
   "e": 18.801
  },
  {
   "text": "Tip three: keep Reels under fifteen seconds.",
